# Dates inside hidden comments and note nodes put nothing in Upcoming, Overdue or Logbook.
file <<END
- Holder
	COMMENTS @hidden @comments
		[2026-10-01 10:00] call back @due({today-1})
		[2026-10-01 10:00] later @due({today+2})
		[2026-10-01 10:00] finished @done({today})
	NOTE @hidden @note
		Body @due({today+1}) @done({today-1})
- Real @due({today+3})
END
keys gU
see ▌ - Real
hide later
hide Body
keys gO
see 󰨱 Overdue
hide call back
hide Holder
keys gL
see 󱓳 Logbook
hide finished
hide Body
